<section class="hero">
  <h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
  <p class="hero__tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
</section>

<div class="page-grid">
  <div class="page-grid__main">
    <p>Edmonton Cycle Club is a leisure cycling club based in Enfield, North London.</p>

    <p>Our <a href="{{ '/diary/' | url }}">regular rides</a> are open to everyone, just turn up! We do however
      recommend joining our announcement WhatsApp group, as rides are occasionally cancelled at short notice.</p>

    <p>We hope to see you on a ride shortly!</p>

    <p>Membership is free - see our <a href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">about</a> page for more information.</p>
